      <Placemark>
        <name>Grand Canyon National Park Lodges</name>
        <description>verified 2026-09-26. Display = Grand Canyon Village Historic District (Wikidata P625), the rim lodge cluster on Village Loop Drive (El Tovar, Kachina, Thunderbird, Bright Angel) that the query 'Grand Canyon National Park Lodges, 88 Village Loop Drive' names; the exact '88' street number could not be located. Drive = Village Loop Drive by Bright Angel Lodge. The optimizer's distance matrix used a different string ('Grand Canyon National Park, Arizona'), so the matrix check does not apply to this page string.</description>
        <styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>-112.138333,36.055556,0</coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
